    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord Community</h1><p></p><br><h1>&quot;Endless Horde Mode!&quot;</h1><p>Early Access is live! <strong>Much more to come!</strong><br>The dev team is working hard some some awesome environments and new quests!<br>We are launching on Early Access with &quot;Endless Horde Mode&quot; with a variety of enemies, and will continue to update the game!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>More Enemies!<br></li><li>More Environments!<br></li><li>More Magic Spells!<br></li><li>RPG Quests!<br></li><li>Weapon Forging/Crafting!<br></li><li>..and much more!</li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong><i>Shadow of Valhalla</i></strong> is a visceral physics-based VR combat game set within an ancient realm of Viking lore and mystic powers. <br>Discover magical runes and unlock spells while battling evil forces throughout eternity!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Immersive gameplay and story-based agency.<br></li><li>Stunning visuals, magical spells and extreme gore<br></li><li>Dynamic enemy AI &amp; physics-based combat<br></li><li>Endless gameplay with progressive difficulty<br></li><li>Cutting-edge weapon interaction system<br></li><li>Player controls inspired by Half-Life: Alyx<br></li><li>Mixed-Reality tools and haptic accessory support</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;The halls of the slain, glorious Valhalla.<br>The ultimate reward for those who die in battle.<br>Combat echos in the souls of ancient warriors throughout eternity.<br>Prepare for Ragnar\u00f6k, the twilight of the gods,<br>..and the end of all existence.&quot; <br>                         -Odin</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><i>Shadow of Valhalla</i></strong> is a visceral physics-based VR combat game set within an ancient realm of Viking lore and mystic powers. <br>Discover magical runes and unlock spells while battling evil forces throughout eternity!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Immersive gameplay and story-based agency.<br></li><li>Stunning visuals, magical spells and extreme gore<br></li><li>Dynamic enemy AI &amp; physics-based combat<br></li><li>Endless gameplay with progressive difficulty<br></li><li>Cutting-edge weapon interaction system<br></li><li>Player controls inspired by Half-Life: Alyx<br></li><li>Mixed-Reality tools and haptic accessory support</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;The halls of the slain, glorious Valhalla.<br>The ultimate reward for those who die in battle.<br>Combat echos in the souls of ancient warriors throughout eternity.<br>Prepare for Ragnar\u00f6k, the twilight of the gods,<br>..and the end of all existence.&quot; <br>                         -Odin</strong></h2>",
